<title>SINGAPORE: Malayan Credit first half net up 88 pct.</title>
<headline>Malayan Credit first half net up 88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    31.18	vs	16.61</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	 8.50	vs	 4.70</p>
<p>    Turnover			83.50	vs	55.42</p>
<p>    Associates		    26.46	vs	 nil</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 43.52	vs	23.17</p>
<p>    Tax			     12.16	vs	 6.63</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (0.18)     vs	 0.07</p>
<p>Note - Malayan Credit Ltd, property unit of car retailer Cycle &amp; Carriage, expects better full year than 1995.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080) at rh</p>
</text>
